--   74935 'Incite!'    -> spell_divisiveness_graduation
--   74937 'Pander!'    -> spell_crazy_graduation
--   74947 'Step Down'  -> spell_step_down_graduation
-- All 4 downported for REAL from k:/tmp/cata-dbc/Spell.dbc+SpellEffect.dbc
